  "notes": [
    "This is a microSD from a DJI RC remote controller (RM330), not a drone or camera card. Primary content is live-view OcuSync transmission caches recorded during flight. Full-resolution drone footage stays on the drone's own microSD \u2014 see the dji-mini-3-pro profile for that card."
  ],
